==Jukebox==
The player can interact with the Jukebox to change the current song. It's possible for the Jukebox to play any [[Soundtrack|music track]] in the game, as long as the player has heard them. Many of them are soundtracks of seasons, as well as soundtracks from Heart Events, or soundtracks from Festivals.

[[File:Jukebox.png|60px]]

==Arcade==
Each of the arcade machines inside the saloon are playable. However, Junimo Kart is initially locked and needs the [[Skull Key]] to unlock it.

===Journey of the Prairie King===
[[Journey of the Prairie King]] is an Arcade Shooter with 3 worlds. Beat them all for a [[Prairie King Arcade System|special reward]].

[[File:Prairie King Arcade System.png|48px]]

===Junimo Kart===
[[Junimo Kart]] is an arcade game which is unlocked with the [[Skull Key]].  Complete "Progress Mode" for a [[Junimo Kart Arcade System|special reward]]. 

[[File:Junimo Kart Arcade System.png|48px]]

===Joja Vending Machine===
Next to the Arcade Machines in the Saloon, there is a Joja Vending Machine that dispenses [[Joja Cola]] for {{Price|75}}.

[[File:Saloon Soda Machine.png|60px]]

==Secret==
If [[Duck Mayonnaise]] is placed in the partially hidden metal box in the back room, the player will receive the [[Secrets|secret]] {{Name|??Pinky Lemon??|class=inline}} statue.

==Trivia==      
* [[Alex#Ten Hearts|Alex's Ten Heart Event]] takes place in the room in the northwest corner of the saloon.

